    {
      "subId": "7415407",
      "subQuestName": "Go and examine the strange box",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741540701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741540701": {
            "id": "741540701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "Considering how persistent you two are, I didn't expect you to just leave it at that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540702"
            ]
          },
          "741540702": {
            "id": "741540702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "I thought you'd go running to the Maison Gardiennage, but you didn't. Looks like you have a few ideas of your own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540705"
            ]
          },
          "741540705": {
            "id": "741540705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "To tell you the truth, you've impressed me quite a bit. If you'd only put your enthusiasm to better use, you'd have bright futures ahead of you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540706"
            ]
          },
          "741540706": {
            "id": "741540706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "It's just a shame that you won't be getting anywhere with this. *sigh* You really aren't afraid, are you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540707"
            ]
          },
          "741540707": {
            "id": "741540707",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You picked the wrong person to intimidate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540708"
            ]
          },
          "741540708": {
            "id": "741540708",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "Oh? So do you really not have a clue what's going on here, or is it because you think you're on the side of justice?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540709"
            ]
          },
          "741540709": {
            "id": "741540709",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "Incidentally, there was an article recently about a merchant who drowned — his name was Brandt. That fellow sure had a way with words alright...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540710"
            ]
          },
          "741540710": {
            "id": "741540710",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "Guess what? According to the paper, it turns out he didn't drown after all, but was in fact murdered and thrown into the lake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540711"
            ]
          },
          "741540711": {
            "id": "741540711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "After a very long investigation, all that the Marechaussee Phantom was able to conclude was that he was murdered, and that the murderer was guilty of a heinous crime.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540712"
            ]
          },
          "741540712": {
            "id": "741540712",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "So that's what the news report said. Who knows what actually happened, or even which one of them deserved to die more — the murderer, or the victim?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540713"
            ]
          },
          "741540713": {
            "id": "741540713",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "Hmm... A tough question, isn't it? I haven't decided what the answer is yet either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540714"
            ]
          },
          "741540714": {
            "id": "741540714",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "Anyway, I digress! This has nothing to do with what we need to discuss.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540715"
            ]
          },
          "741540715": {
            "id": "741540715",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What are you trying to say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741540716"
            ]
          },
          "741540716": {
            "id": "741540716",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Athos",
            "text": "I'm saying that acting recklessly before you've fully understood a situation is foolish, and might bring about some undesirable consequences."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}